{"obsah":"<p>You don't turn down an invitation from a partner – and certainly not when it's to the second-biggest cycling race in the world, the Giro d'Italia, whose first stages were ridden in Budapest. Thanks to <a href=\"https://www.levelsportkoncept.cz\">Levelsportkoncept</a> – specifically POC, the brand I've ridden for for most of my sporting career – my colleague Marek Tryner and I had the chance to experience the atmosphere of such a big event and watch road cycling from the front line. </p>\n\n<p>The exhibition itself took place in a beautiful central park near the start. We had both our team trailer and partners' branded obstacles on site. The sound system was occupied by the broadcast on the big screen, but in the end we found a way to lure spectators to our exhibitions and do a bit of hosting in English. Riding the obstacles was also great training, which sometimes got out of hand and we rode for a few hours straight. </p>\n\n<p>Everything hurts, but hopefully both POC and the spectators were happy – for them it was a very unusual thing compared with the time trials of the guys on road bikes.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_2195.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_2195.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208791\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_5276.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_5276.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208790\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_5277.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_5277.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208789\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_20220507_130829-scaled.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_20220507_130829.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208800\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9990.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9990.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208792\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9988.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9988.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208793\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9986.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9986.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208794\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9959.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9959.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208796\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9956.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9956.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208795\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9904.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9904.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208797\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9905.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9905.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-208798\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9979.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2022%2F05%2FIMG_9979.webp?a